### 1. Get all books
GET http://localhost:9090/api/books

### 2. Filter books
GET http://localhost:9090/api/books?author=Bloch&limit=1

### 3. Get book by ID
GET http://localhost:9090/api/books/1

### 4. Get missing book
GET http://localhost:9090/api/books/999

### 5. Create book
POST http://localhost:9090/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pro Spring 6",
  "author": "Cosmina",
  "year": 2023
}

### 6. Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:9090/api/books/2

### 7. Delete the same book again
DELETE http://localhost:9090/api/books/2